# that cover the portion (computed: 176 of 176 verses; the boundary at 7:89 the chapter's last verse, the next draft opening at 8:1).
# The spine: Onkelos Numbers 4:21-7:89 whole (176 verses) + the Sifrei on Numbers piskaot 1-58 BY POSITION (81 rows at the shelf's row
