# (naso_ink.py); every Hebrew and Aramaic quotation CUT by consonants (the misses collected, asserted empty); the rows in
# naso_rows_onkelos.py and naso_rows_sifrei.py. (Sitting 1's form, write_bamidbar_ledgers.py, split into four modules for the size.)
